  "mode_notes": {
    "e2": "Passive E2 entry-lifecycle mode: V warms 2 transfers then probes 1; the A (P4M) batch is a fixed --a-transfers count (112, 0 for W0); A gap 0; window 5000000 cycles; 4096-byte copies; timeout 2000 ms.",
    "cost": "Natural-cost mode: --transfers is the V transfer count (4096 with warmup 256 in the main stage, 64 with warmup 8 in short). The A (P4M) batch is NOT sized to the V count: it keeps running until V finishes and is then stopped and drained, so this mode has no A-transfer count. acount is therefore 0 (not applicable) for every cost case, including solo, which writes no A pages and is also 0; the runner passes no --a-transfers argument for cost cases."
  },
